WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Describe what you want in one sentence. Farbaek starts a project and drafts a plan.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Read the plan: the goal, what must not change and the design. Approve it to start the build.

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:31.000
The agent works in the open. Every step shows as it happens, and the preview updates.

4
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Before anything goes live, a security check reads exactly these files and scores them.

5
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Publish puts this exact version at its own address. Every version is kept.

6
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Farbaek opens the address and confirms the live site serves exactly this version.
